  "description": "SW3, an old access switch, has won the root election by having the lowest MAC address. Put the core switches in charge and share the load across VLANs.",
  "topology": "                 [SW1] (core)\n          Gi0/1 /       \\ Gi0/2\n         Gi0/1 /         \\ Gi0/1\n   (core) [SW2] ─────────── [SW3] (access)\n          Gi0/2           Gi0/2\n\n  All links are 1 Gbps 802.1Q trunks. VLANs 10 and 20 exist everywhere.\n  SW1 Fa0/1 - 10 connect to PCs. Bridge MACs: SW1 0019.e8a1.1100, SW2 0019.e8a1.2200, SW3 0001.4a00.3300",
  "devices": [
    {
      "name": "SW1",
      "type": "switch",
      "editable": true,
      "mac": "0019.e8a1.1100",
      "interfaces": [
        {
